    "detailed_description": "Abysswalkers is a competitive and tactical trading card game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeing inspired by Tetramaster and Hearthstone, Abysswalkers has similarities to most popular games within the genre that players may be familiar with while also bringing a fun and interesting twist to the gameplay forcing players to strategize and think a little differently than they may be used to.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSet within the Grim Syndicate universe after it was marred by the Daemon Scourge, you will be able to open packs to collect different Daemon and Rune cards to build decks for your Grim Summoner to battle and compete with other Grims that have decided to explore the forbidden wonders of the Abyssal Plane. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect, Trade, and Battle to prove you are the greatest Abysswalker within the ETA.",
    "about_the_game": "Abysswalkers is a competitive and tactical trading card game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeing inspired by Tetramaster and Hearthstone, Abysswalkers has similarities to most popular games within the genre that players may be familiar with while also bringing a fun and interesting twist to the gameplay forcing players to strategize and think a little differently than they may be used to.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSet within the Grim Syndicate universe after it was marred by the Daemon Scourge, you will be able to open packs to collect different Daemon and Rune cards to build decks for your Grim Summoner to battle and compete with other Grims that have decided to explore the forbidden wonders of the Abyssal Plane. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect, Trade, and Battle to prove you are the greatest Abysswalker within the ETA.",
